00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:07.680 align:start position:19%
&gt;&gt; Good evening. My name is Heather Madrid.
I'm a resident of Harmony Meadows. I'm

00:37:05.599 --> 00:37:11.839 align:start position:19%
here in opposition to the Cox Ranch
annexation. During the public services

00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:14.880 align:start position:19%
committee meeting on April 20th, several
facts about this particular parcel were

00:37:13.520 --> 00:37:19.280 align:start position:19%
presented that should make this proposal
a non-starter with no need to postpone.

00:37:17.839 --> 00:37:22.400 align:start position:19%
There are likely endangered plant
species on this property along with bald

00:37:20.880 --> 00:37:25.520 align:start position:19%
eagle and raptor nests which are
federally protected under the bald and

00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:29.359 align:start position:19%
golden eagle protection act and the
migratory bird treaty act. These laws

00:37:27.839 --> 00:37:33.280 align:start position:19%
make it illegal to disturb nests
interfere with eggs and feeding or

00:37:30.880 --> 00:37:36.480 align:start position:19%
raising young. There's also surface low
surface flow from Crow Creek on this

00:37:34.960 --> 00:37:40.400 align:start position:19%
parcel which is an integral part of
Cheyenne's water supply including our

00:37:38.240 --> 00:37:43.760 align:start position:19%
drinking water. Even when it appears to
be dry, there is still water moving

00:37:42.079 --> 00:37:47.920 align:start position:19%
below the surface that helps recharge
the local aquifers. Adding a data center

00:37:46.240 --> 00:37:51.359 align:start position:19%
there will reduce recharge and increase
pollutant loading. The impact of

00:37:49.839 --> 00:37:55.200 align:start position:19%
disrupting this fragile system will
extend beyond this property, weakening

00:37:53.119 --> 00:37:58.000 align:start position:19%
the property rights argument. With all
due respect to the Florida based

00:37:56.480 --> 00:38:01.520 align:start position:19%
property owner, the Colorado based
developers, and the Texas-based

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:04.800 align:start position:19%
operators, Wyoming water rights, our
health, quality of life, cost of living,

00:38:03.200 --> 00:38:09.119 align:start position:19%
and the long-term livability of our
community must come before opportunistic

00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:12.800 align:start position:19%
get-rich schemes. Another concern is
that this proposal follows a recurring

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:17.119 align:start position:19%
pattern of secrecy that prioritizes the
interest of the joint powers board chem

00:38:15.280 --> 00:38:20.880 align:start position:19%
leads and their dual overlapping and
private members over the public's right

00:38:18.720 --> 00:38:24.960 align:start position:19%
to transparent governance. When
representatives from Meta, Microsoft,

00:38:22.800 --> 00:38:28.640 align:start position:19%
Cruso related digital and tall grass pay
for seats on the board of leads which

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:32.160 align:start position:19%
according to their own bylaws guarantees
influence on private economic

00:38:30.079 --> 00:38:36.560 align:start position:19%
development decisions. The public loses
its voice. When Leeds is paid by the

00:38:34.480 --> 00:38:40.160 align:start position:19%
city as the official contracted economic
developer while also acting as the

00:38:38.079 --> 00:38:43.680 align:start position:19%
private land owner and manage sites they
recommend for development, meaning they

00:38:42.160 --> 00:38:47.839 align:start position:19%
stand to profit or otherwise benefit
from their recommendations, an inherent

00:38:45.359 --> 00:38:50.720 align:start position:19%
conflict is created. When the mayor and
county commissioners serve on these same

00:38:49.359 --> 00:38:54.880 align:start position:19%
boards and are involved in the same
private decisions, then participate in

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:58.480 align:start position:19%
related public votes. It raises serious
questions about objectivity. This

00:38:56.880 --> 00:39:02.560 align:start position:19%
council had the opportunity to fix this
in 2023, but chose not to by voting down

00:39:00.640 --> 00:39:06.320 align:start position:19%
an ethics ordinance requiring disclosure
and recusals in such situations.

00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:09.599 align:start position:19%
Cheyenne deserves an economic
development model where our elected

00:39:07.760 --> 00:39:13.040 align:start position:19%
officials make decisions in the open,
not behind the closed doors of a private

00:39:11.440 --> 00:39:16.560 align:start position:19%
nonprofit boardroom where code names
like Project Cosmo are created,

00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:20.320 align:start position:19%
non-disclosure agreements are signed,
and shell companies like Goat Systems

00:39:18.400 --> 00:39:25.040 align:start position:19%
LLC are developed to hide obscure
details from the public. While projects

00:39:22.560 --> 00:39:28.480 align:start position:19%
are fasttracked on land owned by leads,
the public services committee rightfully

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:31.839 align:start position:19%
voted against this annexation partly
because of the impact on our water

00:39:29.920 --> 00:39:35.119 align:start position:19%
supply and partly because the data
center component was withheld from the

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:38.800 align:start position:19%
public. I urge you to follow that
recommendation and vote no, not only on

00:39:37.359 --> 00:39:41.760 align:start position:19%
this annexation but all future
annexations and resonings for the

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:45.920 align:start position:19%
purpose of data centers or business
parks until robust ethics and disclosure

00:39:43.920 --> 00:39:52.880 align:start position:19%
standards are in place. Our elected
officials elected officials should not

00:39:48.320 --> 00:39:52.880 align:start position:19%
be serving two masters. Thank you.

00:39:58.800 --> 00:40:03.599 align:start position:19%
Folks, I'm going to ask you not to do
that, okay? Please, we're uh I

00:40:02.320 --> 00:40:07.720 align:start position:19%
appreciate you guys love what she said,
but uh uh please

